   "notes": "29 Petty Cury (Nanna Mexico), north side between Boots and the Superdry gabled range, faces SSE. Narrow buff-stone neo-Tudor front: charcoal shopfront frame with a teal fascia, a stacked canted stone bay/oriel with mullioned lights over the first and second floors, smaller mullioned window above, parapet. Seen only in oblique distant Geograph views; sizes estimated."
